What do the owner and other-user checks print?

```java
record Expense(long id, String owner, int amount) {}
boolean canRead(String user, Expense expense) {
  return user != null && user.equals(expense.owner());
}
Expense expense = new Expense(1, "alice", 1250);
System.out.println(canRead("alice", expense));
System.out.println(canRead("bob", expense));
```
